  {
    "name": "Category 全生命周期 - 创建/改名/daypart/设备类型/品牌名/删除清理",
    "description": "单接口测试：POST /api/sov/category + PUT /api/sov/category/{id} + PUT /api/sov/category/{id}/daypart + PUT /api/sov/category/{id}/device-types + PUT /api/sov/category/brand-name + DELETE /api/sov/category/{id}。写操作覆盖 create(1553次)/rename(245次)/daypart(400次)/device-types(60次)/brand-name(96次)/delete(146次) 六个近90天有真实流量的写接口。全程只操作本 case 自己创建的一个测试专用 category（AutoTest_SovHub_Category_Lifecycle），用 searchGroupName 精确查回其 id 再逐步操作，最后删除，不触碰账号内任何已有 category。",
    "module": "Category",
    "granularity": "API",
    "since": "init",
    "last_modified": "init",
    "change_type": "NEW",
    "generated_by": "swagger-api-case",
    "steps": [
      {
        "name": "1. 创建测试专用 category",
        "method": "POST",
        "base_url": "{{base_urls.SOVHUBBASEURL}}",
        "headers": "{{headers}}",
        "path": "/api/sov/category",
        "request_body": {
          "brandName": "AutoTest_SovHub_Category_Lifecycle",
          "categoryName": "AutoTest_Category_Lifecycle",
          "clientId": "{{variables.client_id}}",
          "userId": "{{variables.user_id}}",
          "productLine": "AMAZON",
          "categoryBatchId": null,
          "countryCode": "US",
          "isDaypart": false,
          "keywords": [
            "autotest sovhub lifecycle keyword"
          ],
          "deviceTypes": [
            0
          ],
          "zipCodes": [],
          "retailerIds": [],
          "storeIds": []
        },
        "extract_vars": {},
        "expected_response": {
          "code": 200,
          "success": true
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "2. 精确查回刚创建的 category id",
        "method": "POST",
        "base_url": "{{base_urls.SOVHUBBASEURL}}",
        "headers": "{{headers}}",
        "path": "/api/sov/category/page",
        "request_body": {
          "searchGroupName": "AutoTest_SovHub_Category_Lifecycle",
          "pageInfo": {
            "pageIndex": 1,
            "pageSize": 10
          }
        },
        "extract_vars": {
          "lifecycle_category_id": "data.list[0].categories[0].id"
        },
        "expected_response": {
          "code": 200,
          "success": true,
          "data": {
            "list": {
              "$is_array": true
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "3. 改名(主测试 PUT /{id})",
        "method": "PUT",
        "base_url": "{{base_urls.SOVHUBBASEURL}}",
        "headers": "{{headers}}",
        "path": "/api/sov/category/{{lifecycle_category_id}}",
        "request_body": {
          "categoryName": "AutoTest_Category_Lifecycle_Renamed"
        },
        "extract_vars": {},
        "expected_response": {
          "code": 200,
          "success": true
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "4. 开启 daypart(主测试 PUT /{id}/daypart)",
        "method": "PUT",
        "base_url": "{{base_urls.SOVHUBBASEURL}}",
        "headers": "{{headers}}",
        "path": "/api/sov/category/{{lifecycle_category_id}}/daypart?isDaypart=true",
        "request_body": {},
        "extract_vars": {},
        "expected_response": {
          "code": 200,
          "success": true
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "5. 更新设备类型(主测试 PUT /{id}/device-types)",
        "method": "PUT",
        "base_url": "{{base_urls.SOVHUBBASEURL}}",
        "headers": "{{headers}}",
        "path": "/api/sov/category/{{lifecycle_category_id}}/device-types",
        "request_body": [
          0,
          1
        ],
        "extract_vars": {},
        "expected_response": {
          "code": 200,
          "success": true
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "6. 批量改品牌名(主测试 PUT /brand-name，仅限本 case 自建的这一个 id)",
        "method": "PUT",
        "base_url": "{{base_urls.SOVHUBBASEURL}}",
        "headers": "{{headers}}",
        "path": "/api/sov/category/brand-name",
        "request_body": {
          "categoryIds": [
            "{{lifecycle_category_id}}"
          ],
          "brandName": "AutoTest_SovHub_Category_Lifecycle_Renamed"
        },
        "extract_vars": {},
        "expected_response": {
          "code": 200,
          "success": true
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "7. 清理：删除测试专用 category(主测试 DELETE /{id})",
        "method": "DELETE",
        "base_url": "{{base_urls.SOVHUBBASEURL}}",
        "headers": "{{headers}}",
        "path": "/api/sov/category/{{lifecycle_category_id}}",
        "request_body": {},
        "extract_vars": {},
        "expected_response": {
          "code": 200,
          "success": true
        }
      }
